{%- comment -%}
  The standalone placement of the breadcrumb trail: a section a merchant adds at the top of a
  template's section list (product, collection, page, blog, article), independently added, removed
  and reordered there. blocks/mionas-breadcrumbs.liquid is the same trail as a theme block, for
  nesting inside a Section alongside a Heading; both render snippets/mionas-breadcrumbs.liquid, so
  the crumb logic and styles live in exactly one place and cannot drift between the two placements.

  Section *and* block, not one or the other: the trail is a page-level element that usually wants to
  sit above main content on its own (Section's job), but merchants also want it tucked into the same
  container as the page heading so the two share that container's width, background and spacing --
  which only a block can do. Neither placement subsumes the other.

  The trail comes from the merchant's navigation menu first (the `menu` setting, defaulting to
  navigation-menu -- the one sections/header-group.json actually renders, not Shopify's unused
  main-menu starter list), so the crumbs match a path a visitor could actually have clicked instead
  of a parallel hierarchy invented here. Templates the menu has no entry for -- products, articles
  -- fall back to Shopify's template context. See the snippet for the full derivation rules.

  Besides the menu, the settings are the two pieces of copy a merchant would want to localize: the
  Home label and the landmark's accessible name (the design system's own doc says "Set label to
  localize the landmark's accessible name").

  section_width / background_color / padding controls are the same boilerplate every other Horizon
  section carries (see sections/collection-links.liquid) -- merchants get sizing controls to
  match, and contrast-override.liquid gives correct text/link contrast on a custom background for
  free rather than a new bridge rule.

  The setting ids below are referenced by every templates/*.json entry that places this section --
  renaming or removing one silently drops that setting from all of those placements.
{%- endcomment -%}
{% liquid
  assign home_label = section.settings.home_label | default: 'Home'
  assign landmark_label = section.settings.label | default: 'Breadcrumb'

  if section.settings.background_color != blank
    render 'contrast-override', background_color: section.settings.background_color, section_id: section.id
  endif
%}

<div
  class="section-background{% if section.settings.background_color != blank %} color-custom-{{ section.id }}{% endif %}"
></div>
<div
  class="section section--{{ section.settings.section_width }}{% if section.settings.background_color != blank %} color-custom-{{ section.id }}{% endif %} spacing-style"
  style="{% render 'spacing-style', settings: section.settings %}"
  {{ section.shopify_attributes }}
>
  {%- render 'mionas-breadcrumbs',
    home_label: home_label,
    landmark_label: landmark_label,
    menu: section.settings.menu
  -%}
</div>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Mionas: Breadcrumbs",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "link_list",
      "id": "menu",
      "label": "Menu",
      "info": "The trail follows this menu's hierarchy. Leave empty to use the header menu (Navigation Menu). Pages the menu doesn't contain fall back to their collection or blog."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "home_label",
      "label": "Home label",
      "default": "Home"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "label",
      "label": "Accessible name",
      "default": "Breadcrumb",
      "info": "Announced by screen readers to describe the trail. Not shown visually."
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "section_width",
      "label": "t:settings.width",
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "page-width",
          "label": "t:options.page"
        },
        {
          "value": "full-width",
          "label": "t:options.full"
        }
      ],
      "default": "page-width"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "background_color",
      "label": "t:settings.background_color",
      "placeholder": "t:settings.default"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "t:content.padding"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding-block-start",
      "label": "t:settings.top",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 100,
      "step": 1,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 12
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding-block-end",
      "label": "t:settings.bottom",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 100,
      "step": 1,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 12
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Mionas: Breadcrumbs",
      "category": "t:categories.links"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
